# NAME: = TypeTest {{*}}testedType=f5
# RUN(VALUE): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# VALUE: = HasNumberOfBoundArguments
# VALUE: = TypeTest {{*}}testedType=f5
# RUN(INSIDE): walk f6 mechanisms=all
# INSIDE: = HasNumberOfBoundArguments
# INSIDE: = TypeTest {{*}}testedType=f5
# RUN(HANDED): walk f3 mechanisms=all
# HANDED: = HasNumberOfBoundArguments
# HANDED: = TypeTest {{*}}testedType=f5
# The shell itself calls handed(), out of sight of Link, with a Knob as made, with one whose name holds a closure, nothing, a function bound to another this, with an argument, a number; with an object that no constructor filled; with an heir; with a stranger.
